        "id": "intro",
        "type": "nodetool.workflows.base_node.Comment",
        "data": {
          "comment": "# Comfy MOSS Image\n\nGenerate an image on Comfy Cloud with the official MOSS Image template. Requires COMFY_API_KEY and model availability on Comfy Cloud.\n\n**How it works:** The Comfy nodes form the complete MOSS Image graph. Run submits the graph to Comfy Cloud and saves its generated image.\n\n**Try this:** Change value on Text (User Prompt) and run again to compare results. Edit the visible nodes to change settings.\n\nSource: https://github.com/Comfy-Org/workflow_templates/blob/1ae390968e323dba24a6991d1860ded051f5a79b/benchmarks/image_moss_image_t2i.json (MIT). Model licenses apply separately."
        },
        "ui_properties": {
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": -440
          },
          "width": 600
        }
      },
